From 4809d01ace7e30fade521ba26560a853d734032e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JD Lien <jd@jdlien.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:59:56 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] ak820pro (dev): codex's play-times verify -- a type 3 no
 longer renews the title's expiry and applies only while a title is shown (P2
 1: a lost type 1 left the old title up for as long as type 3s landed); the
 playback readout's state moves to graphics/playback.c, pure, where a media
 key's guess (frozen, or resumed from the freeze) is held apart from the
 host's anchor and given back 15 s after the last press, the deadline taken
 before a press is read (P2 2: a second press rebased the anchor, making the
 guess permanent); the icon's guess gets the same deadline; draw_clock
 services the readout before choosing the band's owner (P3 4: Fn+D's exit
 painted the old second). Host test: scripts/playback_test.c (10-20)

